[Mission.Objectives]
Blunt the enemy
[Mission.Description]
Lieutenant Colonel Waters! You must blunt the enemy attack on Tebessa.
[Mission.Success]
The order has been carried out! The enemy has failed to break through to Tebessa.
[Mission.Failed]
The enemy has breached our defenses and is rapidly advancing to Tebessa.
[StringTable.Reinf]
Colonel Waters! Reinforcements are on the way. Hold on!
[Submission1.Objectives]
Hold the line
[Submission1.Description]
Hold the line! The enemy must not break through the pass!
[Submission1.Success]
The enemy has been defeated and is fleeing!
[Submission1.Failed]
The enemy has broken through the defenses! Our troops are retreating to Tebessa.
[StringTable.Woters]
Soldiers, action! We must not yield to the enemy!
[StringTable.Woters1]
Here come Germans.
[StringTable.Woters2]
Reinforcements have arrived.
[StringTable.Woters3]
Damn it! Germans have neutralized the artillery on the height.
[StringTable.tank_spg]
Tanks and Self-propelled Guns
[StringTable.human]
Infantry.